#undef NDEBUG
// Review HN: typed activity keys whose equal objects print apart, CSV "-0"
// cells and the POWL stochastic playout fit.
//
// - /api/analyze-behavior temporal_profile on the log and stream adapters
//   and /api/mine's temporal profile keyed by an attribute or a CSV column
//   whose objects are equal as dict keys but printed apart (0.0 and -0.0, 1
//   and 1.0, 1 and True): pm4py's dict keys each entry by the first pair
//   met. On the dataframe adapter pandas' groupby names a class by its first
//   source and its first target in the pair frame, a CSV float column's
//   -0.0 grouped with 0.0.
// - A CSV cell "-0" reads -0.0 in a column pandas parses as floats and 0.0
//   in an integer column a gap upcasts (temporal and minimum self-distance
//   families on the log, pandas and Polars shapes).
// - /api/playout?miner=powl stochastic fitted from the log under a typed
//   powl_activity_key equals the run on /api/stochastic-map's weights.
//
// Expected values are pm4py 2.7.22 black-box on the same inputs
// (review-harness round-hn: tc/mkhn.py, ct/bh.py, ct/csvfam.py, ct/spfit.py).
//
// Usage: minera_server_review_hn_tests <minera_server>
